                        "glosses": [
                            "to start grunting (of pigs)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf7bff68-db35-46a8-bd9c-fa24151d5a76",
                                "sense_id": "19ee4cfa-47cb-3c3a-8838-45abea24ae9e",
                                "text": "— Да, уж могу́ сказа́ть, по ча́сти спле́тен ху́же нет го́рода! — свире́по закрича́л хозя́ин. — Уж и го́род! Каку́ю га́дость ни сде́лай, сейча́с все сви́ньи о ней захрю́кают.",
                                "translation": "\" Well, as for gossip I can assure you that no town is worse,\" shouted the host. \" What a town ! No matter what you do, all the pigs begin to grunt at you at once.\"",
                                "english": "\" Well, as for gossip I can assure you that no town is worse,\" shouted the host. \" What a town ! No matter what you do, all the pigs begin to grunt at you at once.\""
                            }
                        ]
